   The licence's full text is in COPYING.LIB. The source is at
   https://github.com/bubbob42/WaveSmith

2. The licence covers WaveSmith's own work: the program (WaveSmith/),
   waveform.gadget (Waveform/, Include/gadgets/waveform.h), the modules
   in Common/, the manuals (guide/), the catalogs (catalogs/), the
   Installer script and the readme's template (install/), the classic
   icons the tools draw, the tools (tools/), the tests (test/) and the
   documents (Documentation/).

3. These parts are not covered and keep their owners' terms:

   3.1 Martin "Mason" Merz's art: WaveSmith's GlowIcons (icons/glow/),
       the picture in the About window (art/), and the About GlowIcon
       from his AmigaOS 3.2 icon pack (icons/readme/).

   3.2 AmigaOS 3.2's own icons: its standard installer icon, its
       GlowIcon and its classic image (icons/install/), and the GlowIcons
       of its default drawer and AmigaGuide icons, ENVARC:Sys/def_drawer.info
       and def_amigaguide.info (icons/drawer/, icons/guide/).

       The art in 3.1 and 3.2 is included with permission. The package's
       icons made from it are not covered either: its GlowIcons
       (Files/Icons/Glow/), the icon of the package's drawer, Install.info,
